  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_scarlet_cbe93a4669bbd795584fb7c836a4f00a62d90addb78ac3ba56b7c852e4ae4f01ad">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a rich cloth, often of a bright red colour, but (according to Fr., MDu., and med.L. sources) also sometimes of other colors, as ‘pers’, blue, green, brown; cloth dyed scarlet with kermes (q.v.) (OED s.v. scarlet n. and a. 1a) | a rich cloth, often of a bright red color, but (according to Fr., MDu., and med.L. sources) also sometimes of other colors, as ‘pers’, blue, green, brown; cloth dyed scarlet with kermes (q.v.) (OED s.v. scarlet n. and a. 1a) | (scarlett) a rich cloth, often of a bright red color, but (according to Fr., MDu., and med.L. sources) also sometimes of other colors, as ‘pers’, blue, green, brown; cloth dyed scarlet with kermes (q.v.) (OED s.v. scarlet n. and a. 1a)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
  </rdf:Description>
